 "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape.png", "id": "487236046744268", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75572754_487236050077601_8348865219296916010_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GkbKLBsu9jQQ7kNvwEPwc8s&_nc_oc=AdoD08dJG3l5PSnCaT8gulh6zKCEqX1ybL9VhR8Rb9r6zp7cZU52YFJ9qIflg3yVWsM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE8WOljnf43QL3JPELBOk98sdZ1AjxymWbMrofIg_V-xg&oe=6A707D81"}, "display_name": "3D scan of a campus", "keywords": ["photogrammetry", "reconstruction", "360camera", "digitization", "scan"], "long_description": "Move like a pedestrian in a campus, reconstructed from videos taken by a helmet-held 360 camera (Garmin Virb), whose trajectory is about 5.2km long.\n\nRight controller:\n- Rotate on the left or right by using the joystick\n- Update the vertical offset (up or down) by using the joystick\n- Choose a location and teleport to it by using the virtual laser pointer\n- Teleport by using the index trigger only if the laser is green (not red)\n\nLeft controller:\n- Move continuously by using the joystick\n- Switch pannel and map by using the grip/hand trigger\n- If both map and pannel are disabled, switch between rendering modes (texturing or normal colors) by pressing the index trigger\n- The map shows the cloud of mesh vertices and the user location\n- If the pannel is enabled, switch between constrained and unconstrained motions by pressing the index trigger\n- The constrained motion controls your height above the ground\n- The pannel shows information about the 3D model and the selected motion.\n", "short_description": "Move continuously like a pedestrian in a campus, which was computed by photogrammetry from two 2496x2496 videos taken by a helmet-held 360 camera (Garmin Virb) and by biking about 5.2km in the campus des C\u00e9zeaux (in Aubi\u00e8re, France)."}]}, "developer_name": "Maxime Lhuillier", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://m